<title>JAPAN: Nippon Broadcasting up on Fuji TV listing hopes.</title>
<headline>Nippon Broadcasting up on Fuji TV listing hopes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Broadcasting System Inc shares rose in early Wednesday morning trade, bolstered by hopes that its unit will apply to list its shares on the Tokyo bourse in March, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0042 GMT, the shares were up 500 yen at 10,800.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, Fuji Television Network Inc said it may list its shares on the exchange's first section.</p>
<p>The nationwide broadcaster is a unit of Nippon Broadcasting which listed its shares on the exchange's second section in December 1996.</p>
</text>
